tem information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.6.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (12 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using print_rich() and do a ctrl + f (cmd + f mac) it will search via bbcode.\nGiven example code\nprint_rich(\"[color=blue]EXAMPLE[/color] is super cool\")\n\nWill show this in console with \"EXAMPLE\" in the color blue\nEXAMPLE is super cool\n\nHowever if I try to cmd + f in the output console if I put \"EXAMPLE is\" it will return no results, I instead have to cmd + f \"EXAMPLE[/color] is\" in order to filter the results.\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nprint_rich() anything that uses bbcode such as color, then in output console cmd + f for the string, you will need to include the bbcode if you want to go to the next word\nprint_rich(\"[color=blue]EXAMPLE[/color] is super cool\")\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nprint_rich(\"[color=blue]EXAMPLE[/color] is super cool\")\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co